/* 区域与荒野额外事件库 40 段 + 4 类软坏结局 + 1 个入口 hub = 45 passages / 1段1瞬间、必含检查、失败不扣存款 */
:: MP Region Extra Events Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Park">><</if>>
公园北角猎人行会木牌的侧面钉着一册用防水帆布装订的巡山与海事速写簿，里面按八处秘境与四处险境记满了新近发现的异动。守园人把速写簿翻开固定在铜夹下，提醒你每一页记的都是一处不起眼的角落。你顺着目录核对了方位，挑定了要去查看的一页。
<br><br>
<<if $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] or $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] or $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"]>><<link [[雾角岛：浮标与石屋 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Foghorn BellBuoy]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">雾角岛：浮标与石屋（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] or $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] or $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<link [[机括城：摆锤与星盘 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Clockwork PendulumPit]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">机括城：摆锤与星盘（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] or $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] or $mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<link [[修道院：钟绳与渡口 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Abbey BellRope]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">修道院：钟绳与渡口（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] or $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] or $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>><<link [[温室：喷头与花架 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse MistNozzle]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">温室：喷头与花架（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] or $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] or $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] or $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"]>><<link [[货运站：铁鞋与转盘 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Blackiron BrakeShoe]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">货运站：铁鞋与转盘（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] or $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] or $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] or $mpKnown["druid_pillars"]>><<link [[石环：石槽与藤梯 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Druid LichenRune]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">石环：石槽与藤梯（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] or $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] or $mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<link [[暗层：羽扇与看台 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Velvet FeatherFan]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">暗层：羽扇与看台（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] or $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] or $mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<link [[天文翼：铅锤与芦舟 (0:10)|MP Region Extra Observatory BrassPlumb]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">天文翼：铅锤与芦舟（尚未发现）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[四处险境：机括与钟阁 (0:04)|MP BadEnd Extra Clockwork Cage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<link [[回到行会木牌正面 (0:02)|MP Wild Side Stories Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[离开木牌返回公园 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Region Extra Foghorn BellBuoy [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
雾角栈桥外侧的航道上漂着一座生锈的铁浮标，海浪每拍一下，浮标顶端的铜钟就会发出一声走调的闷响。你借着退潮踩上连接浮标的铁链石台，发现钟舌内侧被人用铜丝绑了一只防水锡管。咸冷的海雾扑在脸上，脚下的礁石滑得几乎站不稳。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角岛口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-bellbuoy">
<<swimicon>><<link "攀上浮标解下锡管 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-bellbuoy">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 270>>
	你迎着浪花稳住重心，探手剪断铜丝取下那只密封锡管，里面装着几枚早年灯塔巡检银币与潮汐记录纸。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_foghorn_bellbuoy_reward")>><<money 480>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺栈桥走向浮木滩 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Foghorn DriftLog]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浪头猛地拍上石台，你手腕一滑没抓稳钟舌，反倒被粗糙的藤壶蹭破了手背，只能狼狈退回岸边。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Foghorn BellBuoy]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Foghorn DriftLog [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
断桅沉船滩的卵石垄间搁浅着一段合抱粗的樟木船桅，木身裂口处塞着半截涂满蜂蜡的麻布卷。两只灰鸥围着裂口啄食干海藻，木桅下方还压着一只掉了锁环的黄铜航海气压盒。潮水正在往卵石滩漫上来，再晚几分钟木桅就要重新浮起。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回断桅船滩 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-driftlog">
<<runicon>><<link "发力撬开船桅裂口 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-driftlog">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	你踩住湿滑的卵石发力撬动木桅，赶在浪头漫过前抽出了蜂蜡麻布卷与完好的黄铜气压盒。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_foghorn_driftlog_reward")>><<money 520>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿岩阶走向守塔旧居 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Foghorn LensCrate]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	樟木船桅被海水泡得极沉，你撬到一半脚下卵石滚落，脚踝磕在木棱上隐隐作痛，只能眼看潮水漫过裂口。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[稳住呼吸再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Foghorn DriftLog]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Foghorn LensCrate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
守塔人石屋后方的备用储藏间里摆着一只钉满木条的折射透镜箱，箱盖缝隙里透出淡淡的擦镜酒精味。值班手札上记载这只箱子装的是早年换下来的副灯棱镜，但箱角的三枚铁钉明显有新撬动过的亮痕。屋外的海风吹得石窗框哐当作响。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回守塔石屋 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-lenscrate">
<<sneakicon>><<link "顺着旧钉眼撬开箱盖 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-lenscrate">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>>
	你用薄铁片顺着旧钉眼轻轻一别，木箱盖无声滑开，绒布垫下除了完好的副棱镜还藏着一袋旧港备用银币。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_foghorn_lenscrate_reward")>><<money 640>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转去石屋缆绳间查看 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Foghorn RopeLocker]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你拔钉时用力过猛，木条啪地折断，箱内弹簧卡扣瞬间锁死，飞起的木刺还扎痛了指尖。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[调整手法再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Foghorn LensCrate]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Foghorn RopeLocker [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
石屋侧面的缆绳储物柜里盘着十几卷浸透桐油的救生麻缆，最内侧的木钩上挂着一只沉甸甸的铅坠皮袋。桐油气味浓烈刺鼻，几根带铁钩的抛绳器交错卡在柜门上方，稍不留神就会钩落下来。你借着煤油灯的微光看清皮袋口用双死结系着。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回守塔石屋 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-ropelocker">
<<tendingicon>><<link "理顺铁钩解开皮袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-ropelocker">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	你先将顶部的抛绳铁钩一一拨正，再顺着麻绳纹理巧手解开双死结，从皮袋里倒出了守塔人攒下的修船津贴。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_foghorn_ropelocker_reward")>><<money 460>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去回音廊看潮位尺 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Foghorn TideGauge]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你拉扯皮袋时碰落了顶上的抛绳铁钩，沉重的麻缆砸在肩膀上，震得你半天抬不起手臂。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准位置再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Foghorn RopeLocker]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Foghorn TideGauge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
海蚀回音廊入口的垂直岩壁上嵌着一根青铜潮位标尺，标尺顶端的水位浮球卡在了石缝的盐晶里。风穿过石拱发出低沉的呼啸，浮球下方连着的细铜链正随着暗涌一紧一松。你探身望去，盐晶壳后面似乎压着一只扁平的油皮钱袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回海蚀回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-tidegauge">
<<investigateicon>><<link "化开盐晶取出钱袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-foghorn-tidegauge">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	你用温水化开卡住浮球的盐晶壳，铜链随之顺畅滑落，那只封存完好的油皮钱袋也正好弹进你掌心。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_foghorn_tidegauge_reward")>><<money 580>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	你直接伸手硬拽铜链，锋利的盐晶刮破了虎口，钱袋反而滑进了更深的石槽里。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Foghorn TideGauge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Clockwork PendulumPit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
青铜齿轮回廊中段的铸铁格栅下方是一口深不见底的副摆锤井，巨大的黄铜扁摆每隔四秒便从井口掠过一次。井壁内侧的检修铁架上搁着一只遗落的皮革工具袋，袋口露出一柄镶银卡尺。规律的气流带着温热的机油味从井底涌上来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回齿轮回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-pendulumpit">
<<runicon>><<link "看准摆锤间隙取袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-pendulumpit">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
	你算准扁摆荡向对侧的四秒空当，俯身探入检修架一把抄起工具袋，袋里除了卡尺还装着一叠修表匠的工钱。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_clockwork_pendulumpit_reward")>><<money 680>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿回廊走向输油管 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Clockwork OilConduit]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你探身时慢了半拍，凌厉的摆风擦着额角掠过，吓得你猛然缩手，手肘重重磕在铸铁格栅上。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干手心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Clockwork PendulumPit]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Clockwork OilConduit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
蒸汽压力室北壁的三号黄铜输油管设有一处透明玻璃视窗，视窗底部沉积着一枚闪着金光的齿轮徽章与几枚银币。管道旁的泄压旋钮正冒着细碎的白雾，管壁温度颇高。要想打开沉积槽底盖，必须先把上下游的两个止回阀同时扳平。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回蒸汽压力室 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-oilconduit">
<<investigateicon>><<link "关闭止回阀旋开底盖 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-oilconduit">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 270>>
	你对照管壁上的箭头先关死上游油阀，再垫着厚布旋开底盖，毫发无损地取出了里面的齿轮徽章与银币。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_clockwork_oilconduit_reward")>><<money 620>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去档案馆看穿孔盘 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Clockwork PunchCardTray]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你拧错了阀门方向，温热的机械润滑油顿时喷了一手，烫得你连忙后退，底盖也没能拧开。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Clockwork OilConduit]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Clockwork PunchCardTray [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
档案馆密库角落的铸铁分类架上放着三盘黄铜穿孔卡片，卡片按市政钟塔的历年报时曲目排列。最右边那盘卡片的铁轴歪斜着，底下压着一封用铜箔封口的津贴领用单。密库里的通风扇发出低沉的嗡鸣，空气干燥而微凉。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-punchcardtray">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按齿孔顺序排齐卡片 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-punchcardtray">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 270>>
	你按穿孔卡片的二进制齿孔顺序排齐错位卡，铁轴应声落回卡槽，底下的铜箔津贴单与备用币顺利抽了出来。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_clockwork_punchcardtray_reward")>><<money 740>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转去天文台看风箱 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Clockwork BrassBellows]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你强行抽动卡片，好几张脆硬的黄铜薄片卡死在铁轴间，指尖被铜片边缘划得生疼。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫稳重心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Clockwork PunchCardTray]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Clockwork BrassBellows [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
停摆天文台侧面的报时风箱由厚实的牛皮与黄铜肋板制成，风箱折皱深处卡着一只小巧的发条音乐盒。风箱连杆还挂在半满的配重块上，一旦触碰不当，配重块落下就会把风箱压扁。穹顶上方垂下的星象铜链在微风里轻轻晃动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回停摆天文台 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-brassbellows">
<<sneakicon>><<link "卡住棘轮取出音乐盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-brassbellows">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
	你先用铁销卡死配重连杆的棘轮，再探手进牛皮折皱取出那只精密发条盒与夹层里的古币。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_clockwork_brassbellows_reward")>><<money 780>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去穹顶下看星象盘 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Clockwork StarDial]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你刚伸手进折皱，配重棘轮咔哒滑了一格，风箱猛然合拢夹痛了你的小臂，你费力抽手才没被卡住。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凑近微光再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Clockwork BrassBellows]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Clockwork StarDial [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
天文台主观测椅下方的青石地面嵌着一圈黄道十二宫铜环，铜环中央的指针槽里积满了陈年石英粉。你用鞋尖扫开浮灰，看见双子座与处女座的刻槽下各露出一角防水油纸包。头顶的天球仪折射下微弱的冷光。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回停摆天文台 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-stardial">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按古星图拨动铜环 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-clockwork-stardial">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	你按照学园古星图的岁差方位拨动外环，两处刻槽同时弹开，你顺利取出了油纸包里的纪念银币与星图残片。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_clockwork_stardial_reward")>><<money 660>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	你记错了岁差方向，铜环卡死在半途，飞扬的石英粉呛得你连声咳嗽。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动手指再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Clockwork StarDial]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Abbey BellRope [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
静默石阶尽头的偏殿拱顶下垂着三根粗麻钟绳，中间那根麻绳在离地两米处打了一个奇怪的活结，结眼里夹着一只纯银奉献匣。偏殿地面铺着湿滑的青苔石砖，两侧立着半坍塌的石柱。幽暗的回廊里只有远处暗河的水声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-abbey-bellrope">
<<runicon>><<link "蹬住石柱拉下银匣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-abbey-bellrope">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	你蹬住侧壁石柱凸起轻巧跃起，一拉活结便将那只纯银奉献匣稳稳接在怀里，没有惊动顶上的哑钟。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_abbey_bellrope_reward")>><<money 540>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去藏经阁看火漆匣 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Abbey WaxSeals]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你起跳时脚底青苔打滑，拽钟绳的力道重了些，顶上落下一蓬陈年灰土迷了眼睛，摔得屁股生疼。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开滑处再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Abbey BellRope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Abbey WaxSeals [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
灰烬藏经阁靠里的石案上摆着一只分格木盘，里面盛着十几枚未曾使用过的古修道院蜂蜡火漆印与几枚银币。木盘外罩着一层薄薄的铅丝网，网扣与抄经台的青铜墨水瓶连在一起。空气里飘着淡淡的没药与旧羊皮纸气味。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回灰烬藏经阁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-abbey-waxseals">
<<sneakicon>><<link "托住平衡簧挑开网扣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-abbey-waxseals">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>>
	你用细镊子托住墨水瓶底座的平衡簧，轻轻挑开铅丝网扣，将里面的古银币与完好的火漆印收入囊中。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_abbey_waxseals_reward")>><<money 720>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去回音壁看净手盆 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Abbey StoneBasin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铅丝网扣弹开时带倒了青铜墨水瓶，虽然瓶里只剩干涸的黑粉，却还是弄脏了你的衣袖，卡扣也锁死了。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[按住底座再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Abbey WaxSeals]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Abbey StoneBasin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
告解回音壁外侧的壁龛里嵌着一只白石净手盆，清澈的冷泉水从石雕兽口中一滴滴落入盆内。水底铺着一层细碎的白石子，石子间掩埋着一枚刻有圣咏音符的银质徽章与零散钱币。泉水冰冷刺骨，盆底排水孔的吸力颇大。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回告解回音壁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Confess]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-abbey-stonebasin">
<<templeicon>><<link "探入冰泉捞取银徽 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-abbey-stonebasin">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
	你忍住刺骨的寒意将手探入冰泉底部，稳稳捏住那枚圣咏银徽与钱币一并捞了出来。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_abbey_stonebasin_reward")>><<money 500>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去唱诗席查看木座 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Abbey ChoirStall]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰泉冻得你五指发僵，手指刚碰到银徽就打了个寒颤，水流将钱币冲进了排水暗孔。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Abbey StoneBasin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Abbey ChoirStall [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
回音壁后方的旧唱诗席排列着两排胡桃木折叠椅，第七张椅子的翻板下方钉着一只装乐谱的暗木匣。由于年代久远，翻板的黄铜合页锈蚀严重，稍微用力就会发出刺耳的摩擦声。四周的声学穹顶会将任何响动放大数倍。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回告解回音壁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Confess]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-abbey-choirstall">
<<tendingicon>><<link "抹上蜡油翻开木座 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-abbey-choirstall">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	你先取了一点长明灯座里的蜡油抹在合页缝隙，悄无声息地翻起木板，取出了暗匣里的泥金残页与礼金。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_abbey_choirstall_reward")>><<money 600>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去暗河渡口看铁链 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Abbey FerryChain]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你硬掰生锈的翻板，刺耳的吱呀声在声学穹顶下回荡不绝，震得你耳膜生疼，暗匣也卡在了木槽里。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[稳住呼吸再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Abbey ChoirStall]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Abbey FerryChain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
地下暗河渡口的石拱桥下挂着一条牵引渡船的粗铁链，铁链中段的圆环上拴着一只涂满黑沥青的防水皮囊。暗河水在这里打着旋涡，水面漂浮着零星的荧光苔藓。要想够到那只皮囊，得踩着湿滑的桥墩石沿探出半个身子。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回暗河渡口 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-abbey-ferrychain">
<<swimicon>><<link "探身桥墩解下皮囊 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-abbey-ferrychain">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>>
	你扣紧桥墩上的铁环探出身去，稳稳解下那只沥青皮囊，里面装着早年摆渡人留下的渡资与古印章。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_abbey_ferrychain_reward")>><<money 640>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	桥墩石沿滑不留手，你探身时小腿擦过粗糙的石壁，皮囊没解下来反倒溅了一身冰冷的暗河水。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调整手法再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Abbey FerryChain]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Glasshouse MistNozzle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
雾化兰花厅东侧的紫铜喷雾管不知被什么堵住了，水汽从法兰盘接缝处嘶嘶外泄，正对着下方一株名贵的夜光兰直喷。法兰盘底座的石槽里卡着一只掉了搭扣的描金小鼻烟盒。空气里弥漫着温润浓郁的兰花香气。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾化兰花厅 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-mistnozzle">
<<tendingicon>><<link "拧紧喷头取出烟盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-mistnozzle">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	你先将夜光兰花盆移到安全处，再用铜扳手拧紧法兰盘垫圈，顺手把石槽里的描金鼻烟盒与零钞取了出来。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_glasshouse_mistnozzle_reward")>><<money 560>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去标本廊看种子柜 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse SeedCabinet]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你伸手去掏鼻烟盒时被突然喷出的温热水汽烫到了手腕，花盆也差点被碰翻。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准位置再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse MistNozzle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Glasshouse SeedCabinet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
夜光标本廊靠墙立着一座三十六格的樟木种子柜，其中标着『银脉草』的那一格抽屉被铜片锁着，拉环上挂着一张泛黄的采购收据。柜面打着厚厚的蜂蜡，旁边放着诺艾尔平时用来称量草籽的小天平。窗外的树影透过玻璃投在柜门上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-seedcabinet">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按配重克数拨开暗簧 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-seedcabinet">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 270>>
	你按照天平托盘下记录的配重克数拨开抽屉暗簧，顺利取出里面封存的银脉草籽管与采购结余款。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_glasshouse_seedcabinet_reward")>><<money 680>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[查看旁边的玻璃钟罩 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse BellJar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你拉扯抽屉时力度不对，铜片簧锁死在滑轨里，樟木边角还夹痛了你的食指。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse SeedCabinet]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Glasshouse BellJar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
标本廊长桌尽头罩着一只半米高的吹制玻璃钟罩，里面陈列着一枝镀银干花与一枚蓝宝石胸针托。钟罩底部用红蜡与大理石底座封合在一起，旁边摆着一盏酒精灯与细铜刀。要是硬掀钟罩，薄如蝉翼的吹制玻璃很容易碎裂。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-belljar">
<<sneakicon>><<link "温刀划蜡抬起钟罩 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-belljar">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
	你用酒精灯微微烘软細铜刀，沿着大理石底座将红蜡齐整划开，稳稳揭起钟罩拿到了胸针托与礼金。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_glasshouse_belljar_reward")>><<money 820>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[下楼去酿造室看蒸馏釜 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse CopperStill]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你烘刀的温度不够，刀尖在硬蜡上一滑撞响了玻璃钟罩，吓得你连忙收手，虎口也被震得发麻。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干手心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse BellJar]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Glasshouse CopperStill [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
地下酿造室中央的鹅颈紫铜蒸馏釜刚停火不久，冷凝盘管的接水口下挂着一只密封的纯银小扁壶。蒸馏釜周围还留着醇厚的花露与果酒余温，地面砖缝里散落着几枚滚落的银币。盘管阀门上缠着一圈防烫麻绳。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回地下酿造室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-copperstill">
<<tendingicon>><<link "关严冷凝阀取下银壶 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-copperstill">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
	你缠好防烫麻绳关严冷凝阀，卸下那只纯银小扁壶，又把砖缝里的银币一一拾起擦净。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_glasshouse_copperstill_reward")>><<money 600>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[登上穹顶露台看花架 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse VineTrellis]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你没留意盘管余温，手指直接碰在紫铜管壁上烫出一道红印，手忙脚乱间还踩滑了脚下的木垫板。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse CopperStill]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Glasshouse VineTrellis [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
玻璃穹顶露台的铸铁花架上爬满了铁线莲，高处横梁的藤蔓交缠处挂着一只被风吹落的女式金丝零钱包。花架下方的藤椅旁放着一把修枝剪，露台外侧便是多瑙河庄园深邃的树篱。微凉的穿堂风从天窗缝隙吹进来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回玻璃穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-vinetrellis">
<<runicon>><<link "攀上花架勾下零钱包 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-glasshouse-vinetrellis">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	你踩着铸铁花架的横档轻巧攀援而上，在不伤花藤的前提下用修枝剪勾下了那只金丝零钱包。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_glasshouse_vinetrellis_reward")>><<money 540>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	花架上的露水让鞋底打滑，你伸手去勾钱包时被铁线莲的枯枝刮乱了头发，重重跌坐回藤椅上。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳重心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Glasshouse VineTrellis]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Blackiron BrakeShoe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
废弃调车场五号股道的止轮铁鞋下卡着一只防水帆布工具袋，袋角用黄铜铆钉封着。铁轨旁堆着生锈的道钉与碎石渣，一节空平板车正好停在半坡上，全靠这只铁鞋顶住车轮。空气里飘着浓重的煤焦油味。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回调车场股道 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-region-extra-blackiron-brakeshoe">
<<runicon>><<link "垫稳枕木抽出工具袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-region-extra-blackiron-brakeshoe">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800>>
	你先搬来两块备用枕木塞死平板车后轮，再一脚踹松止轮铁鞋，顺顺当当地抽出了底下的帆布工具袋与工钱。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_extra_blackiron_brakeshoe_reward")>><<money 620>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
