	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP Region Extra Blackiron TurntablePit]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Extra Druid LichenRune [nobr]
